# Timmie's prompt blocks, verbatim from ../timmie-character.md. Source this file, then build
# prompts as "$IDENTITY $FACE $SCENE $NEVER". $SCENE defaults to the website hero; set your own.
IDENTITY='Timmie, KnowAll AI'\''s timekeeper: EXACTLY the graphite robot in the reference image, same design, proportions and materials: a smooth rounded helmet dome and two rounded ear cups in glossy deep graphite-black enamel with thin lime-green (#9dff0a) trim lines on the dome, visor edge, ear cups, shoulders and chest seams; a wide dark smoked-glass visor; a dark ribbed graphite neck collar. On top of his dome, instead of antennae, a single large knurled polished silver stopwatch crown with a ring loop above it and two small silver pusher buttons angled either side, so his head reads as a stopwatch. A large polished silver stopwatch on a lime-green lanyard around his neck. Friendly, cheerful, male, non-human robot. Photoreal cinematic render, never a toy or cartoon. Exactly ONE Timmie.'
FACE='FACE: exactly TWO separate round, solid, evenly glowing lime-green (#9dff0a) eye discs with no pupils, and a short dim dashed lime line low on the visor. No mouth, no nose, no eyebrows, no human face.'
NEVER='NEVER: no antennae, no pencil, no glasses, no eyeshade, no hat, no hair, no bow tie, no scarf, no clothing, no logos, no readable text, letters, numbers or numerals anywhere, no watermark.'
HERO_SCENE='Scene: he holds his left hand palm-up in front of his chest, and just above his palm floats a glowing luminous lime-green (#9dff0a) holographic stopwatch made of light, with a crown button on top, a simple dial with only tick marks and two hands, fine lime sparks and thin light rings orbiting it. It lights his hand, visor and chest from below and in front.'
HERO_COMPOSITION='Composition: wide 3:2 website hero. Timmie, his hand AND the floating stopwatch all stay entirely within the RIGHT 50% of the frame; he is shown from the waist up, turned slightly towards the left. The LEFT 50% contains nothing at all: no hand, no sparks, no glow, only a calm, very dark near-black (#0a0a0a) background, left clear for a headline. Low-key cinematic lighting, near-black background, subtle lime-green rim light on his edges.'
SCENE="${SCENE:-$HERO_SCENE $HERO_COMPOSITION}"
